      "text": "PEPTIDOGLYCAN (murein):\n  Alternating N-acetylglucosamine (NAG) and N-acetylmuramic acid (NAM)\n  Cross-linked by peptide bridges\n  Gives shape + osmotic protection"
    },
    {
      "id": "01-BACTERIAL-BIOLOGY.md#010",
      "path": [
        "01-BACTERIAL-BIOLOGY.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
