        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Bacterial Biology",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "GRAM-POSITIVE EXTRAS:\n  ─ Teichoic acids: Polyol-phosphate polymers in peptidoglycan\n  ─ Lipoteichoic acids: Anchored to membrane, extend to surface\n  ─ Detected by: TLR2 (innate immune recognition)"
    },
    {
      "id": "01-BACTERIAL-BIOLOGY.md#011",
      "path": [
        "01-BACTERIAL-BIOLOGY.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:microbiology:01-bacterial-biology, git-history:microbiology:01-bacterial-biology]",
        "canonical_path": "microbiology/01-BACTERIAL-BIOLOGY.md",
