        "title": "Bacterial Biology",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "EXCEPTIONS (neither gram+ nor gram-):\n  Mycobacteria: Acid-fast stain; mycolic acid-rich wall (waxy)\n    → Impermeable → many antibiotics don't penetrate\n    → TB: requires months of therapy\n  Mycoplasma: No cell wall → intrinsically resistant to β-lactams\n```"
    },
